        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Trim Audio to a Range\n\nCuts the audio from a video down to a start and end point. Pair it with Inspect a Clip's Audio when you need the duration before you choose where to cut.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Clip\" takes the video. \"2 Extract audio\" pulls out the soundtrack, \"3 Trim\" keeps the part from 0.5 to 4.0 seconds, and \"4 Audio\" returns the trimmed track.\n\n**Try this:** Change start and end on \"3 Trim\" to keep a different range of the clip."
        },
